- Chart: monthly revenue vs monthly burn for the last 12 months (trend).
- Table: assumptions driving each scenario (hiring, CAC spend, major contract timing).
- Appendix: detailed monthly cash-flow model, sensitivity table (how many months runway at different burn rates).

