B. One-paragraph executive summary (conservative)
“Summit holds $5.2M in cash. Using our current forecast assumptions, this supports approximately 20 months of runway, implying a net burn of ~$260K/month. Given last quarter revenue of $3.2M, the runway reflects planned spend; we recommend immediate reforecasting, scenario analysis, and selective expense controls to ensure runway flexibility.”

